    narr:narration """On 2026-07-28, the adoption of Zypherion for the analytics pipeline is performed as a settled decision through two complementary registers. Quinton, as CTO, [declares the adoption outright](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) in present-tense realis — \"We are adopting\" — and [commits to a migration timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) starting next quarter, exercising legitimate authority in a technical register. Xena then [records the key decisions](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) in a structured, matter-of-fact format — [database choice](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5) and [timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_7) — shifting the footing from declaration to documentation. The arc moves from voiced authority (decision-conviction, authority-ranking, activated-positive affect) to informational recording (decision-conviction, matter-of-fact register, calm conservation), but both modes perform the same move: closing the decision rather than opening it for input. The stylistic throughline is parallelism and short-punchy cadence — the structured list format itself signals that the items are settled, not proposed.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_7> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We are adopting Zypherion for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The migration starts next quarter.\"" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Key decisions:" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "- **Database**: Zypherion for analytics" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "- **Timeline**: Migration starts Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_7> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Quinton voices the decision as present-tense declaration (legitimate power, activated-positive); Xena records it as matter-of-fact documentation (informational power, calm) — two distinct performances of 'settled' that could diverge if the recording ever outruns the authority behind it." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The adoption is present-realis ('We are adopting') while the migration is future-irrealis ('starts next quarter') — the decision is settled but the execution is still prospective, leaving a gap between commitment and action." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3> ] ;
